# Dotfiles

This repository contains my personal configuration files (`dotfiles`) for Linux, mainly focused on **Hyprland**, **Waybar**, **kitty**, and other tools I use daily. These files allow me to quickly set up my environment on a fresh system.

---

## Folders and Contents

- **hypr** – Configuration for Hyprland (tiling window manager).  
- **kitty** – Configuration for the Kitty terminal emulator.  
- **mako** – Notification daemon configuration.  
- **mpv** – Custom configuration for MPV media player.  
- **nvim** – Neovim configuration.  
- **vs-code** – Settings and extensions configuration for VS Code.  
- **waybar** – Bar configuration for Hyprland.  
- **wofi** – Application launcher configuration for Hyprland.

---

## Usage

1. Clone this repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/moaaadl/dotfiles.git

